  "body": "A bespoke statement of prestige and sophistication, this architecturally designed, concrete and cedar residence captures timeless elegance, exceptional craftsmanship and spectacular lake views in one of the North Shore’s most exclusive enclaves.\r\n\r\nDesigned by MDS and completed in 2018, the 368 sq m residence occupies a 601sq m freehold site and delivers an exceptional standard of contemporary luxury. Five generous double bedrooms, including three ensuites, are complemented by multiple living spaces with fireplaces, creating an effortless balance of refined entertaining and relaxed family living.\r\n\r\nAmerican oak flooring flows throughout, while the designer kitchen and fully appointed scullery form the heart of the home. Expansive living areas open seamlessly to a spectacular Louvre-tec covered entertaining space, creating a sophisticated setting for year-round gatherings while making the most of the home's elevated outlook and lake views.\r\n\r\nSecurely positioned behind automated gates and fully fenced for privacy, the residence offers both sanctuary and convenience. Families will appreciate its highly sought-after school zoning, including Westlake Boys, Westlake Girls and Takapuna Grammar, while the CBD is just 17 minutes away.\r\n\r\nAn exceptional expression of architectural design, luxury and lifestyle, this is a residence of rare distinction in one of the North Shore’s most coveted locations.\r\n\r\nContact Lewis Guy at New Zealand Sotheby's International Realty for more information.",
